          {
            "text": "In a candidate questionnaire, he said he would introduce legislation to mandate minimum staffing levels for federal offices that enforce disability rights.",
            "cites": [5]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "As a state legislator, Biss helped create Secure Choice, a retirement savings program, and passed legislation that led to a ban on conversion therapy for LGBTQ+ youth. His campaign says that as mayor, he helped create the Crisis Alternative Response Evanston program, which sends social workers and others to low-risk service calls and has answered more than 1,500 of them. His campaign says he also passed a Healthy Buildings Ordinance to curb carbon emissions.",
